# Surveillance Monitor: "Whenever you collect evidence, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying." (CR 701.59a, 603.2): any
# evidence you collect counts, not only the Monitor's own. Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Monitor (an empty graveyard, so no question) with four
# Moxes; turn 3 it casts Forensic Researcher and Entomb for Counterspell; turn 5 the Researcher collects evidence 3 (Entomb 1 and Counterspell 2) to tap
# Bot2's Memnite, and the Monitor makes a Thopter.

